980
01:12:01.119 --> 01:12:02.463
CPU-heavy tasks:

981
01:12:02.743 --> 01:12:05.708
Bounded platform pool = cores, bounded queue.

982
01:12:05.988 --> 01:12:07.801
Fan-out to several services:

983
01:12:08.081 --> 01:12:10.705
StructuredTaskScope (wrapped) with budgets.

984
01:12:10.985 --> 01:12:12.244
Request context:

985
01:12:12.524 --> 01:12:13.569
ScopedValue.

986
01:12:13.849 --> 01:12:15.449
Protecting a dependency:

987
01:12:15.729 --> 01:12:19.484
Semaphore or bulkhead per dependency, adaptive if possible.

988
01:12:19.764 --> 01:12:21.492
Producer faster than consumer:

989
01:12:21.772 --> 01:12:25.292
Bounded queue; drop only when newer data supersedes older.

990
01:12:26.642 --> 01:12:31.122
JDK 21 to 23 with legacy synchronized I or O:

991
01:12:31.402 --> 01:12:33.237
ReentrantLock, or upgrade.

